# Dragon Ball Z: The Legacy of Goku II (USA, ALFE): the Scouter's area map (DBZ2-2, DBZ2-8) and the flying
# world map (DBZ2-6) on the second screen. The Scouter comes 20-30 minutes into the game, so this goes through
# the game's own Debug menu instead: with 0x0202B32D held at 2 (a cheat, below), START twice on the title
# opens it, and its Map Test starts a field in any area with every fighter and the Scouter.
#   3ds/test/dualrun.py ALFE <this file> OUT --runs mgba,armgba-3ds --cheats 3ds/test/cheats
# (3ds/test/cheats/Dragon Ball Z - The Legacy of Goku II (USA) (Code Breaker).cht: 3202B32D 0002, on)
wait 600
shot title
mash START 6 60
wait 60
press DOWN 4
wait 12
press DOWN 4
wait 12
press DOWN 4
wait 12
# the ZONE row: 49 steps on is zone 3, area 1 (the Northern Wastelands, beside a World Map sign)
mash RIGHT 49 10
press UP 4
wait 12
shot debug
press A 4
wait 400
shot field
# walking about: the map follows
hold DOWN 60
wait 90
shot down
hold LEFT 60
wait 90
shot left
hold RIGHT 60
wait 90
shot right
# the game's own map (R) and pause menu (START), then closed: the second screen keeps its picture (DBZ2-5)
press R 6
wait 90
shot own_map
press B 6
wait 120
shot own_map_closed
press START 6
wait 90
shot pause
press B 6
wait 120
shot pause_closed
# back up to the World Map sign and A: flying (DBZ2-6)
hold UP 120
wait 60
shot at_sign
press A 4
wait 120
shot takeoff
press A 4
wait 240
shot flying
hold UP 120
wait 60
shot flying_north
hold RIGHT 120
wait 60
shot flying_east
hold LEFT 120
wait 30
hold DOWN 120
wait 60
shot flying_back
# A over the place lands there: the area's map again
press A 4
wait 400
shot landed
hold DOWN 60
wait 90
shot landed_walked
